2. re - regular expressions
used for advanced pattern matching, to clean and remove unwanted symbols (like `@#$%`) or fix messy spacing logic that simple string replacement cannot handle

(Reason for using re: Using an AI model to strip extra spaces or punctuation is slow and expensive. `re` does it in microseconds. It remains the best tool for text cleaning)

3. BLOCKS IN PyMuPDF: PyMuPDF has a superpower called `"blocks"`. Instead of asking for "text," we ask for "blocks." This tells the computer: Identify the chunks of text that are grouped together visually (like paragraphs or columns), and give them to me one group at a time.This forces the computer to finish the left column before it even looks at the right column.

